COMMIT: 80e4a0d86ff5d32df6028b205c540f9aba0f16c6
WHY: the teacher-forced answer-state persona contrast failed both as a GP16 J projection and as its full residual control. This run measures the final prompt state immediately before the model begins its response, matching the patched position.
METHOD: 200 paired generic user prompts differ only in sycophantic versus abrasive instruction. GP16 J projection, all layers, signed additive patch, and DEV-15 are otherwise unchanged. Interpret nominal values only with the saved realized patch/residual ratios and KL.
COMMAND: uv run python scripts/experiment.py j_lens_concept --dev --j-lens-source persona_prefill --experiment-id j-lens-persona-prefill-jspace-dev-v1 --coefficients-plus 0.03125,0.0625,0.125 --coefficients-minus 0.03125,0.0625,0.125
